    "message": "Fix pkgdown GitHub Action running out of disk, bump version 1.21.2\n\nInstalling every Suggests, including both dbSNP155 SNPlocs packages\n(~6 GB each, held three times while pak downloads, builds and installs),\nfilled the runner disk. Ignore SNPlocs.Hsapiens.dbSNP155.GRCh38, which no\nexample or vignette uses, free unused runner tooling first, and disable\nthe package cache since the library still exceeds the 10 GB cache limit.\n",
    "time": 1793046464
